        "frontmatter": {
          "author": "Tencent Healthcare Omics",
          "description_en": "Collect WDL, Nextflow and Lambda status and logs through the Omics CLI to diagnose failures, performance and output publication issues.",
          "description_zh": "通过组学 CLI 只读采集 WDL、Nextflow 和 Lambda 状态与日志，诊断失败、性能及结果发布问题。",
          "version": "1.0.4"
        },
        "id": "omics-run-diagnosis",
        "path": "vendor/OmicsSkill/skills/omics-run-diagnosis",
        "repository": "git@git.woa.com:genomics/ai/OmicsSkill.git",
        "source_header": "---\nname: omics-run-diagnosis\ndescription: 诊断组学平台 WDL、Nextflow 和 Lambda 任务失败、无结果或运行慢。使用当前 omics CLI 的 status/debug 只读取证，按项目定位 RunGroupId、RunUuid 和 JobId，结合日志、Pod 事件与结果文件分析根因并提出修复建议。适用于 OOM、输入预处理、命令失败、镜像拉取、调度、存储权限和结果发布问题。\n---\n"
      }
    ]
